er\"\n          >\n            Mesafeli Satış Sözleşmesi\n          <\/a>\n        <\/li>\n\n        <li>\n          <a\n            href=\"https:\/\/footbalance.com.tr\"\n            target=\"_blank\"\n            rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n          >\n            FootBalance.com.tr\n          <\/a>\n        <\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n    <\/div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"fb-footer__column\">\n      <h3>Hesabım<\/h3>\n\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n          <a href=\"\/account\/login\">Giriş Yap<\/a>\n        <\/li>\n\n        <li>\n          <a href=\"\/account\/register\">Kayıt Ol<\/a>\n        <\/li>\n\n       \n      <\/ul>\n    <\/div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"fb-footer__column\">\n      <h3>Hakkımızda<\/h3>\n\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n          <a href=\"\/pages\/iade-politikasi\">İade Politikası<\/a>\n        <\/li>\n\n        <li>\n          <a href=\"\/pages\/contact\">Bize ulaşın<\/a>\n        <\/li>\n\n<li>\n          <a href=\"\/blogs\/icerikler\">Blog<\/a>\n        <\/li>\n\n        <li>\n          <a href=\"\/pages\/sss\">S.S.S<\/a>\n        <\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n\n\n\n      <div class=\"fb-footer__badges\">\n\n        <div class=\"fb-footer__badge fb-footer__badge--etbis\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0999\/6255\/2616\/files\/etbis.webp?v=1788890985\"\n            alt=\"ETBİS'e Kayıtlıdır\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          >\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"fb-footer__badge fb-footer__badge--return\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0999\/6255\/2616\/files\/30gungaranti.webp?v=1788890986\"\n            alt=\"30 Gün Koşulsuz İade\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          >\n        <\/div>\n\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n  <\/div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"fb-footer__bottom\">\n    <div class=\"fb-footer__bottom-inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"fb-footer__copyright\">\n        © {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} FootBalance Türkiye. Tüm hakları saklıdır.\n      <\/div>\n\